<title>SWEDEN: Electrolux - sales, profits by division.</title>
<headline>Electrolux - sales, profits by division.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are divisional sales and profits for appliance maker Electrolux.</p>
<p>			    (millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p>    SALES				Q1 1997	 Q1 1996</p>
<p> Household products		  18,886	   18,031</p>
<p> Commercial appliances		2,406	    2,491</p>
<p> Outdoor products		     4,617	    4,156</p>
<p> Industrial products - Granges    2,370	    2,083</p>
<p> Industrial products - other	  436		821</p>
<p> Total				   28,715	   27,582</p>
<p>OPERATING INCOME</p>
<p> Household products		     642		681</p>
<p> Commercial appliances	   LOSS  69		 13</p>
<p> Outdoor products			 421		379</p>
<p> Industrial products - Granges	112		 92</p>
<p> Industrial products - other	   10	   LOSS 9</p>
<p> Total				    1,116	    1,156</p>
<p>-- Simon Haydon, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1004</p>
